cff-version: 1.2.0
title: darvis/mkg-client
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A PHP client for the REST API of MKG Software, the Dutch ERP system. It handles
  the Tomcat form login and the JSESSIONID session, and provides a typed service
  layer over the MKG documents for sales orders, order lines, debtors, articles,
  relations, addresses, contact persons and users. Framework-agnostic, with a
  Laravel service provider.
